    "description": "<p>Effective only when all your [Hand Slots] are empty. Your bare hand [Attack Power] and &nbsp;[Magical Power] is equal to [CR + ((INT Mod)&times; 2)]. You get one [Illusion Weapon] tag at the start of the scene. This tag is lost at the end of the scene.&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style in which he creates numerous weapons using genjutsu and manipulates them freely.</p>",
